= Definition

#definition(title:[Relative Dimension])[
    Suppose $X/S$ is an $S$-scheme, if for all points
    $ s: Spec k -> S $
    the fiber $ X_s = X times_S Spec k $ is of pure dimension $d$, then we say that $X/S$ is of _relative dimension_ $d$.
]
